msgctxt ""
"\n    OneSpace stores a small amount of data on your device. Some of it "
"is\n    cookies; some of it is local storage, which works the same way "
"for our\n    purposes. This document covers both.\n"
msgid "cookies"
msgstr "ملفات الارتباط"

msgctxt ""
"\n    You can clear this data in your browser at any time; you will be "
"signed out\n    and your preferences will return to their defaults. "
"Blocking the session\n    cookie means you cannot sign in.\n"
msgid "cookies"
msgstr "ملفات الارتباط"

