msgctxt ""
"\n    Content stays until you delete it. Deleted files sit in the "
"workspace's bin\n    and are recoverable for a limited period before "
"they are destroyed. Version\n    history is thinned over time and "
"forgotten after ninety days. Sign-in and\n    error records are kept for "
"a rolling period and then discarded. Billing\n    records are kept for "
"as long as the law requires. When a workspace ends, the\n    lifecycle "
"in the Terms of Service applies.\n"
msgid "privacy"
msgstr "الخصوصية"

msgctxt ""
"\n    OneSpace is a product for work and is not directed at children. Do "
"not\n    create an account for anybody under eighteen.\n"
msgid "privacy"
msgstr "الخصوصية"

msgctxt ""
"\n    We share personal data with the suppliers who make the service "
"work, and\n    with nobody else, except where the law requires it or "
"where you ask us to.\n    Every one of those suppliers is listed in the "
"Subprocessors document, with\n    what they receive and where they hold "
"it, and each is bound by terms no less\n    protective than these.\n"
msgid "privacy"
msgstr "الخصوصية"

msgctxt ""
"\n    Your workspace's data is held in the region chosen when it was "
"created, and\n    files in the object-storage location that goes with "
"it. Some of our\n    suppliers operate globally; where data leaves the "
"United Arab Emirates or\n    the European Economic Area, it does so "
"under the transfer terms described in\n    the Data Processing "
"Addendum.\n"
msgid "privacy"
msgstr "الخصوصية"

